{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1455018-aberrant-is-there-any-plans-for-the-higher-quantum-aberrant-powers","id":1455018,"title":"[Aberrant] Is there any plans for the higher quantum aberrant powers?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-16T03:00:16-07:00","id":1455018,"title":"[Aberrant] Is there any plans for the higher quantum aberrant powers?","content":"Granted, for a number of them, you can just use scaling with the currently published powers, but for things like Ecological supremacy, etc, that were originally in the player's guide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","user":"IanWatson","date":". 07-18-2021, 05:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-16T03:40:51-07:00","id":1455021,"title":"","content":"Most of the Authorities and Supremacies it\u2019s all about scale, you are changing the shape of a massive number of creatures, or changing the geological activity of an entire planet or some other effects. At least that\u2019s the idea for the most \u201cinstantaneous\u201d powers, as some of them have effects that take long time to show up, like the increase in radiation resistance in the animal population over generations.<br /> <br /> For this long efforts, I would say you need no specific power, you just use your powers to do power stunts and set the results, or just talk to SG so they can use it in the plot. I mean, the rules were convoluted and it was all about rolling dice to determine the time it take to get the effect.<br /> <br /> Same for universe creation, it\u2019s just a plot hook and a way to do a amazing retirement to your character, there is little to no uses for it that are not about abducting people and locking them out of range of absolutely any one except you.<br /> <br /> Last one, Plank scaling, is just a way to allow your character to do any thing with a power stunt of your choice, with no limitations in theme or who can use it. Once you get Q9, I see no reason to not allow this kind of effect as standard for any lower scale end.<br /> <br /> Well, that\u2019s my opinion, I would be glad to discuss in details of my opinion and how to use it in game. Personally my aberrant games never got to that end game situation, so I have a theoretical view of them in game, but I never saw any big use of most of them other than plot and time off descriptions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-16T23:19:14-07:00","id":1455064,"title":"","content":"Yes, people forget power stunts in TC:Ab and those really cover a lot of corner cases. Some things might be power stunts for two separate powers (for example, create living things with a combination of biological powers and Quantum Agent to provide them with motive force).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2334-aliasi","name":"Aliasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2334_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-18T01:41:59-07:00","id":1455097,"title":"","content":"True. Granted, I`'d like to see some closer rules for &quot;quantum projects&quot; say along the line of sorcerous workings for Exalted, since most of these higher level powers are less &quot;blast something&quot; than they are &quot;fundamentally change things.&quot; <br /> <br /> Huh, I wonder if modifying the invention rules might work? instead of inventing a thing, you're inventing a change in the environment around you. <br /> <br /> That+ power stunts for more casual use might work, especially given that even the old players handbook pointed out that in most cases, probably only a few, maybe even a single, nova would ever have any printed power.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-18T03:31:53-07:00","id":1455100,"title":"","content":"My suggestion is, instead of modifying invention rules, treat the \u201cfundamental change\u201d as a Goliath, and \u201cfight\u201c it over long periods of time, maybe a roll every few months or year, or even generations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-18T14:07:20-07:00","id":1455127,"title":"","content":"The Aeon Trinity's Medea Initiative was formed, &quot;<span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">as a response to an </span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Aberrant with the power to literally make words poi</span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">sonous and ideas viral&quot; while China's system of laws were designed by a nova and </span></span>can't be replicated elsewhere, so canon has quantum powers producing some truly absurd effects. This sounds like odd uses of the invention rules to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-18T16:08:32-07:00","id":1455132,"title":"","content":"The Chinese law system for sure is an invention, but poisonous words and viral ideas are powers with some weird combination of tags.<br /> <br /> Lets say you can say a word that causes a condition to anyone that listen and, if that person repeat it it will cause the same condition to anyone that listen it. The condition is a disease and will eventually get worse and kill the person and all that listen to it. Quantum attack with Non lethal (it will kill but takes some time), Subtle, Impose (so it will replicate), sonic (to ignore armor, and because it is spoken). That would cover the practical use in game, the rest (people getting sick and dying of it is an extra that would not really affect any character other than those that need to be affected, basically a narrative plot.<br /> <br /> The idea is get the effects you need for the situation, power stunt anything you need to happen in a long term or slight out of expected initially and let the narrative fill the rest. The SG can do the same, but it would be just GMing\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}